      "sha256": "dfdc41ec178bb89a516699c28fee5eed6c59d1073a1752f5dcc50edd7d158dd6",
      "verificationMethod": "direct-http+pdf-text-extract",
      "excerpt": "Satyendra Nath Bose was born on the New Year's Day, January 1, 1894, in Calcutta. He sent a duplicate copy of the manuscript, which was entitled \"Planck's law and light quantum hypothesis,\" to Einstein in Berlin, with a request to have it translated into German and published in the Zeitschrift für Physik. Einstein immediately translated Bose's paper into German.",
      "excerptSha256": "e9a41fb37a585976fd76a58d50e65fa27d12b62594d8b6cf2d74016b4de2d946"
    },
    {
