      "contentType": "text/html; charset=utf-8",
      "bytesRead": 89535,
      "sha256": "888ad74c008622db30871725642fdd28a862f02bb159236a58be172a08c41012",
      "verificationMethod": "direct-http",
      "excerpt": "Forster, Edward Morgan (1879-1970). Morgan Forster, as his friends knew him, was born on 1 January 1879. He came up to King's College, Cambridge, in 1897. First they went to Florence, in October 1901, which inspired his novel A Room with a View.",
      "excerptSha256": "c83928301e07b38c9137d6bc8527778a3443bd0272276eebb8541ee20f6d0862"
    },
    {
      "id": "forster-penguin",
